# 0i_sand_hall: GunTurret bases u043d/u0423, tops u043a/u0424. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 42b935e4,0i_sand_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u043a 15 300
@f330 scan u043d 15 300
@f600 fsm u043d IntoPan
@f700 fsm u043d PanLeft
@f800 fsm u043d PanRight
@f900 fsm u043d AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u043d Flinch
@f1100 fsm u043d CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u043d OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u043d Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u043a PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u043a PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u043d Attack
@f1600 damage u043a 5
@f1700 damage u043a 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u0423 Patrol
@f1900 statecall u0423 IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u0423 IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u0423 IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u0423 AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u0423 AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u0423 AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u0423 Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u0423 Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u0423 Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u043a
@f2200 obj u043d; obj u043a
@f2300 tp 350 -60 9
@f2900 obj u043d; obj u0423
@f3000 kill u0424
@f3300 objs GunTurret
